        "summary": "Remote OK remote jobs",
        "description": "The newest remote jobs on Remote OK (about 100 per tag), optionally for a tag such as `python`, `design` or `marketing`, and narrowed by a text match (`q`) or location text. Each job: id, title, company and logo, location, tags, salary range (USD per year when given), posting time, description (text and HTML), job link and apply link. Remote OK asks that you link back to each job's `url` and name Remote OK as the source.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/remoteok-jobs",
